<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on COSCO.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on COSCO.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said it has launched 554 million American-style call warrants on shares of COSCO Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$5.52	PREMIUM	 8.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.19527   GEARING	 3.69X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  22.SEP.97    PAYDATE	 07.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$6.90</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
